        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur ARCPRT, Traditional Arc Rose with Portofino Lever</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Traditional Portofino Lever with Arc Rose has classic appeal that is great for historic homes or homes with a traditional design. The Arc Short Plate with Portofino Lever will fit most pre-drilled doors. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.  Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur ARCPRT Arc Short Plate with Portofino Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Portofino Lever with Arc Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.63\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2.22\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4.75\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2.5\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-ARCPRT-Specifications.pdf?v=1704262387\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur ARCPRT Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working, smooth lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Traditional Portofino Lever with Arc Rose",
                "description": "The Traditional Portofino Lever with Arc Rose has classic appeal that is great for historic homes or homes with a traditional design. The Arc Short Plate with Portofino Lever will fit most pre-drilled doors. It will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.  Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
